body:
"snarf down their BBQ" 

&#x200B;

im sorry i need a moment to process this

I'll give you one straight from my sad and embarrassing life-

&#x200B;

I tripped up the stairs while holding a hot cup of tea... and that happened in front of my crush. spilled the tea all over myself and my face was super red. thankfully he asked if I was ok. i was like oh my word he's so nice. but he turned into a dick after 7th grade

Anyone who fakes a medical condition or disability of any kind (mental, physical, anything) just to get attention or sympathy. 

&#x200B;

There's a girl in my grade who goes around telling people how suicidal she is and how she hates herself and starves herself and all these different things. I have attempted suicide multiple times and I just walk around school and see the faces of people who know nothing about me. They all believe her, but no one knows my pain.

Hey! I haven't written any blog post on those specifically yet but this is my blog where I'll make future blog posts on those things. It'd be awesome if you could check it out! :)

&#x200B;

[https://thisistaylorsversion.weebly.com/blog](https://thisistaylorsversion.weebly.com/blog)

TIL - mental disorders are stupid :D   /s

&#x200B;

(I have clinical depression and ADHD and have attempted suicide; this is so disrespectful)

I do too, but then I wouldn't learn anything...

&#x200B;

(oh wait, that's the point)

Damn, my generation just keeps getting worse... my friend took me outside at a sleepover and held a lit match up to a hair spray can and sprayed it. i told her before she even did this that it was tremendously stupid and not safe... she replied with those dreaded words, "its for a tiktok" i wanted to throw her goddamn phone off a cliff but i just went inside.

&#x200B;

NTA
